    <briefdescription>
<para>Shared or weak pointer to a Memo, according to context. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is used by LazyPtr for its memo field. It records the context of the pointer: whether it is part of a member variable or not, and keeps a weak or shared pointer to the Memo according to that context. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
